WEBVTT

NOTE
Sorceress Edea's parade in Deling City — approaching the Presidential gate.
Duration: approximately 10 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Aboard the parade float, the view descends interior steps.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.650
Through a banner-flanked archway, Deling City's floodlit gate and fountain appear at night.
